	BCDASC		/   BCDASC STARTING ADDRESS		   /A003/M016
	CDF 30		/   BCDASC ASSEMBLES IN THIS FIELD (RUNS IN 5)	/A003
	-DSMBCD		/   NUMBER OF BLOCKS TO WRITE OUT		/A003
DLMTHL			/ Write out MATH holes. Start at this block	/a019
	200		/   MATH hole starting address			/a019
	CDF 60		/   MATH holes assemble in this field		/a019
	-DSMTHL		/   Number of blocks to write out		/a019
0


