/
/  056  LAD      Changes to recognize newly valid format:
/      a valid image may be smaller than the medium on which it
/      resides. This situation can only be true on RX50 and RD5x
/      A system image must always use all of an RX01/02 and must
/      be at least 800 blocks on RX50 and RD5x.
/  055  LAD  to 10/26/84  BP problems being addressed & going into
/      Version 2.0. This is a continuation of the clarifying
/      re-write and V2.0 functionality ongoing in 054.
/
/  054  LAD  to 8/8/84  Add logic & modify logic to recognize &
/      properly handle RD50 based systems.  Added ^P in CRSHM2
/      from 1.5 bug fix.  Added logic in WPSDET to look for
/      possible COS images & warn the user that the media may
/      not be in WPS format, added message "BEWARE". FIXED A
/      bug in CHKCOS: it has never checked COS COUNTS correctly
/      due to a data field error.
/
/  053  LAD  07-JAN-84  Add logic: unless the medium being ver-
/      ified has a valid WPS Home block or Allocation block,
/      it is considered to be of class "utility" and structure
/      checking and copying will not be allowed.
/

