/TD056  DCA  T3    /USE T3 AS A TENS COUNTER    /C055
/TD056  TAD  (1100    /GET STARTING LINENO -1      /A054
/TD056  DCA  LINENO    /INITIALIZE LINENO      /A054
/TD056VBLKLP,  CDFBUF                /A054
