/TD056  DCA  X2    /SAVE IT
/TD056  TAD  VBLKNO    /SET UP FUNNY FOR OUTSIDE WORLD    /A054
/TD056  DCA  SBLKNO    /PUT IN ZERO PAGE FOR UNIVERSAL ACCESS  /A054
/TD056  TAD  SBLKNO    /GET THE BLOCK NUMBER BACK    /A055
/TD056  CIA      /NEGATE IT FOR COMPARISONS    /A055
/TD056  SMA      /IF NON-0 CHECK BLOCK 6      /A055
/TD056  JMP  ISSYS    /DON'T CHECK BLOCK 0      /A055
/TD056  TAD  (6    /SEE IF ITS BLOCK 6      /A055
