  MQA
  TAD  (BLKLST)  /CHECK ATTRIBUTES
  DCA  T1
  CDFLST      /GET INTO THE LIST FIELD    /A054
  TAD I  T1
  AND  (2377)    /FREE,ERROR,USED
  SNA      /KEEP THE NUMBER FOR CHKFLE    /A055
  ISZ  VEHBCH    /BUMP TO OK RETURN
HBCNOK,  CDFBUF                /A054
  JMP I  VEHBCH

