	JMP	FMTDGO		/ RETURN ENTERED- INITIALIZE IT		/A066
	JMP	CPYDS2		/ GOLD MENU- QUIT W/O INITIALIZING	/A066
FMTDGO,	JMP I	SHOWNM							/A066


