/	THIS IS THE RX50 BOOT HEADER FOR WPS IN 8 BIT FORMAT:		/A042
R5BHDR,									/A042
	0	/ BYTE 00	TYPE 2 BOOT BLOCK			/A042
	0	/ BYTE 01	TYPE 2 BOOT BLOCK			/A042
	2	/ BYTE 02	POINTER TO SECOND SECTION		/A042
		/		(1/2 ACTUAL VALUE IN BYTES)		/A042
	1	/ BYTE 03	1=SYSTEM, 0=DOCUMENT DISKETTE		/A042

