/-----------------------------------------------------------------------/A083
/WHEN COPYING FROM H.D. TO FLOPPPY THE RXMAP TABLE IS USED		/A083
/...THIS MAP CONTAINS THE NUMBER OF TRACKS ON THE FLOPPY		/A083
/....IT IS USED EVEN THOUGH THE SOURCE MAY BE VOLUME ON THE H.D.	/A083
