/....... OF TRACKS IN THE TABLE .. THE THIS SHOULD ELIMINATE THE XTRA	/A083
/....... PROCESSING..   MOVE SRCSZE TO TRKMXK....			/A083
/....... THIS MOVE AT THE PRESENT TIME WILL NOT BE PUT INTO THE 	/A083
/....... AS WE ARE READY TO SHIP AND TESTING MAY NOT BE SUFFICIENT.	/A083
/
/------- THIS MESSAGE  COURTESY OF  DFB ----------------------------	/A083


