CUDTMP,	0			/ LOCATION FOR INTERNAL DATA VERSION	/A037
	0			/ LOCATION FOR INTERNAL ROM  VERSION	/A037

	*100			/ FIRST 100 LOCATIONS ARE USED FOR THE SYSTEM

