/D034	TAD	(SIGNAT)	/ SIGNATURE=-7531			/A032
/D034	TAD	F1DATE		/ WHAT IS SIGNATURE?			/A032
/D034	SZA CLA			/ IS DATE IN P.M. IN FORMAT		/A032
/D034	JMP	DTSAME		/ NO DON'T WORRY ABOUT IT		/A032
/D038		AC0003			/ SET UP MASK FOR DATE BITS		/A032
