	SKP			/SET IT AND DO IT			/A029
NOBORD,	TAD	NOBPTR		/NO BOARD MESSAGE			/A029
	DCA	PRTPTR		/SET POINTER				/A029
	CIFMNU			/NEED TO BE IN MENU FLD			/A024
	JMS I	IOACAL		/GO TO THE TTY I/O ROUTINE		/A024
