NXTABS,	JMS	BHOOK		/ Blast in code 			/A044
	NXTDED			/ Routine name				/A044
	 JMP	NXTAOK		/ Pass start and End dead through	/A044
	 JMP	NXTABK		/ Not valid , treat as break		/A044
