/ UDK CODE; CHKUDK, CHUDK0, CHRDU0

		/ ENTRY POINTS FOR UDK DISK ACCESS, CHKUDK, CHUDK0
		/ CALLED FROM U1XLAT IN WPSYS
		/ ENTRY POINTS AT PERMANENT LOCATION
