CHUDK0,
	XX

	CDFMNU
	DCA CHUDKA		/ SAVE TRANSLATED INPUT

	TAD CHKUYY		/ SAVE RETURN ADDRESS
	DCA CHUDK0

	TAD I (UDKINH		/ TEST INHIBIT FLAG
	SZA CLA
