RTRN4A, GOTFLD		/GET CDI TO CALLING FIELD			/M041
	DCA BAKFLD	/SAVE THE CONSTRUCTED CDI INSTRUCTION FOR THE RETURN
/D041	JMS ITLZOL	/INIT RESULT PTR TABLE PTR & TABLE		/M012
	TAD (RESULT	/GET STARTING ADDRESS OF RESULT PTR TABLE	/A041
	DCA RESPTR	/INITIALIZE PTR TO RESULT PTR TABLE		/A041
	DCA I RESPTR	/INIT 1ST LOC OF RESULT PTR TABLE TO ZERO	/A041
/D041	JMS ITLZO2	/INIT SYMBOL PTR TBL PTR, SYMBOL TABLE PTR	/M012
	TAD (SYMTBL	/GET STARTING ADDRESS OF SYMBOL TABLE		/A041
